    "Steam Deck also sets Aspect Ratio to 16:10, Render Resolution to 720p (1280 x 800) and VSync to Off on the Display tab, and Swap Gyro Yaw/Roll and Invert Gyro Yaw on the Controller tab. Changing a choice makes the preset Custom. With Texture Streaming below the GPU's memory, textures keep fewer mip levels: first those not drawn for a while, then the largest.": "「Steam Deck」還會將「顯示」分頁的「長寬比」設為 16:10、「渲染解析度」設為 720p (1280 x 800)、「垂直同步」設為「關閉」，並開啟「控制器」分頁的「交換陀螺儀偏航/翻滾」和「反轉陀螺儀偏航」。變更任一選項後，預設組合會變為「自訂」。當「材質串流」低於 GPU 記憶體時，材質保留的 Mip 層級會減少：先從一段時間未繪製的材質開始，再來是最大的材質。",
